# Local development secrets
# Secrets Store bindings are NOT available in `wrangler dev`.
# Add your Google AI API key here for local development.
# GOOGLE_AI_KEY is handled via .dev.vars as a plain string fallback — see note below.
#
# NOTE: The Secrets Store binding (env.GOOGLE_AI_KEY.get()) won't work locally.
# For local dev, set the key as a wrangler secret or use the D1 config table.
